---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { name: 'Terms of Service', href: '/terms/' },
];
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of Service & Usage Policy - ${siteConfig.brand}`}
  description={`Read the official Terms of Service for ${siteConfig.brand}, covering client-side usage rules, warranties, limitations of liability, and privacy guarantees.`}
  canonical={`${siteConfig.url}/terms/`}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-8">
      Last modified: November 12, 2026 • Editorial Draft (Requires Legal Review)
    </p>

    <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to {siteConfig.brand} ({siteConfig.domain}). By using our site, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with them, please stop using our tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. How Our Services Work</h2>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.brand} provides free online tools for file conversion, compression, and calculations. Our software runs directly in your web browser. Speed and limits depend on your computer, your phone, and your local memory (RAM).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. Your Files and Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Your files stay on your device. We never upload your files to our servers. Because of this, you keep full ownership and copyright of your files and results. You must make sure you have the right to edit, convert, or share any files you use here.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        We provide all tools and guides "as is." We work hard to make our tools accurate and fast. However, we do not promise that the site will never have errors, or that broken files will always work.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Under the law, {siteConfig.company} and its team are not liable for any losses. This includes lost files, browser crashes, or memory issues from using our tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. Proper Use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use our free tools for school, personal work, or business. You must not attack our servers or try to block others from using the site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">7. Changes and Contact</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. If you keep using the site after changes, you accept the new terms. If you have questions, write to us at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`} class="text-green-600 underline font-medium">{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
